cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Refurbished iPhone prices dataset
message: >-
  If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: Price Radar
    website: https://www.priceradar.live
abstract: >-
  Entry prices of refurbished iPhone models, observed twice a day on the
  French, American, German and Spanish Back Market storefronts and kept as a
  dated time series. Collection began on 13 August 2026.
keywords:
  - refurbished
  - iphone
  - smartphone
  - price tracking
  - time series
  - e-commerce
  - consumer electronics
  - open data
license: CC-BY-4.0
url: https://www.priceradar.live
date-released: 2026-09-06
